WEBVTT

NOTE English translation of the Polish subtitles burned into the film.

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.461
Data, not opinions. Air, housing prices, methodology: what the figures say and what they do not

2
00:00:04.461 --> 00:00:09.082
Air quality: annual values of the monitoring stations, calculated by the EEA.

3
00:00:09.082 --> 00:00:13.691
The chart: every station and the limit value.

4
00:00:13.691 --> 00:00:18.903
Before: mean 2016–2018. After: mean 2020–2022. 2019 left out.

5
00:00:18.903 --> 00:00:23.710
This is a comparison over time, not proof of cause.

6
00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:28.520
Weather, the pandemic year and other measures were not taken out.

7
00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:33.701
Housing market: transaction prices from the register, not asking prices.

8
00:00:33.701 --> 00:00:38.708
Only medians from at least 10 transactions, no single prices or addresses.

9
00:00:38.708 --> 00:00:43.920
District medians cover different flats; they do not compare like with like.

10
00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:48.526
The limitations are on the same page as the figures.

11
00:00:48.907 --> 00:00:53.709
Methodology: principles, limitations and what was not checked.

12
00:00:54.090 --> 00:00:58.696
Downloads: GeoPackage, CSV and a QGIS project.

13
00:00:58.696 --> 00:01:03.299
Licences and source notes verbatim, in the original language.

14
00:01:03.299 --> 00:01:08.314
Sources: Air: EEA; data: GIOŚ (CC BY 4.0); Housing prices: Rejestr cen nieruchomości, Prezydent Miasta Krakowa (powiat 1261); dane udostępnione przez Główny Urząd Geodezji i Kartografii w serwisie www.geoportal.gov.pl; opracowanie własne (mediany, bez danych jednostkowych); District boundaries: © OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL). Full source notes and licences: the „Dane” page.
